ASI SHA-256: [code]06EE760E33E499252AF072711C28D55D2D65127E50B98A3E4FD26B39ADEC1B63[/code]

The exact final ZIP reported 0/68 on VirusTotal. The exact ASI reported 4/71; this is no regression from public 2.1.10's 5/71 result. Local Microsoft Defender custom scans reported no threat for either exact file. These results apply only to the hashes above.

